{"unit_id":"TZYCeng__dsh-model-visibility#card-zh","repo":"TZYCeng/dsh-model-visibility","commit":"b2e0bc7c60d2a798d0939e3e831bca508e047463","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"模型显示 · dsh-model-visibility 是面向 DSH 网页端的模型管理插件。它在设置页提供模型显示面板，并过滤对话模型菜单。用户可按提供商分组隐藏模型、查看推理能力、上下文窗口、输入模态和模型类型，还能搜索、筛选、折叠分组并手动修正能力信息。插件可探测提供商模型列表，并为确认支持图像的中转站模型开放图像输入。适合需要整理模型菜单或辨认模型能力的 DSH 用户；探测与图像对齐可在设置中调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:102","client.js:1","lib/model-info.js:223"]}
{"unit_id":"TZYCeng__dsh-model-visibility#card-en","repo":"TZYCeng/dsh-model-visibility","commit":"b2e0bc7c60d2a798d0939e3e831bca508e047463","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-visibility manages the DSH web model menu. It adds a settings panel to hide models and inspect modalities, context windows and reasoning support. Users can search, filter, group and edit model details. It can inspect provider listings and enable image input for capable relay models.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:102","client.js:1","lib/model-info.js:223"]}
