{"unit_id":"TZYCeng__dsh-model-visibility#feature-1","repo":"TZYCeng/dsh-model-visibility","commit":"b2e0bc7c60d2a798d0939e3e831bca508e047463","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"模型显示 · dsh-model-visibility 的功能「per-model-visibility」：逐模型控制模型菜单的显示状态，并按提供商分组批量隐藏或显示。隐藏当前会话正在使用的模型时仍保留当前选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1","index.js:102"]}
{"unit_id":"TZYCeng__dsh-model-visibility#feature-2","repo":"TZYCeng/dsh-model-visibility","commit":"b2e0bc7c60d2a798d0939e3e831bca508e047463","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"模型显示 · dsh-model-visibility 的功能「capability-labels」：模型列表展示能力来源、类型、输入模态、上下文窗口和推理档位；用户可搜索名称并按类型或能力筛选。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1","lib/model-info.js:223"]}
{"unit_id":"TZYCeng__dsh-model-visibility#feature-3","repo":"TZYCeng/dsh-model-visibility","commit":"b2e0bc7c60d2a798d0939e3e831bca508e047463","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"模型显示 · dsh-model-visibility 的功能「manual-overrides」：用户可编辑模型类型、上下文、输入模态和推理档位，Host 保存覆盖，并可将对应字段写回提供商配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/model-overrides.js:1","lib/provider-write.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"TZYCeng__dsh-model-visibility#feature-4","repo":"TZYCeng/dsh-model-visibility","commit":"b2e0bc7c60d2a798d0939e3e831bca508e047463","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"模型显示 · dsh-model-visibility 的功能「relay-image-input」：对能力判断为支持图像的中转站对话模型，适配器模型对象可补充 image 输入标记，使请求准入使用该能力判断。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/image-input-gate.js:1","lib/model-info.js:493"]}
{"unit_id":"TZYCeng__dsh-model-visibility#feature-5","repo":"TZYCeng/dsh-model-visibility","commit":"b2e0bc7c60d2a798d0939e3e831bca508e047463","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"模型显示 · dsh-model-visibility 的功能「provider-probing」：Host 可读取配置的提供商模型列表，并合并探测结果、适配器信息和内置目录来展示模型能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/provider-probe.js:359","lib/model-info.js:685"]}
